---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Schema from '../components/Schema.astro';
import Breadcrumbs from '../components/Breadcrumbs.astro';
import CtaBand from '../components/CtaBand.astro';
import { organizationSchema, breadcrumbSchema } from '../data/schema';
import { business } from '../config/business';

const path = '/about';
const crumbs = [{ name: 'Home', path: '/' }, { name: 'About', path }];
---
<Layout
  title="About Keres AI: Websites & AI Receptionist"
  description="Keres AI builds and runs websites and Google Business Profiles for local service businesses, and answers their calls with Remi, an AI receptionist."
  path={path}
  pageType="AboutPage"
  mainEntityId="https://www.keresai.com/#organization"
>
  <Schema slot="head" graph={[
    breadcrumbSchema(crumbs),
    organizationSchema,
  ]} />

  <Breadcrumbs crumbs={crumbs} />
  <header class="page-hero container">
    <span class="eyebrow">About</span>
    <h1>About <span class="accent">Keres AI</span></h1>
    <p class="lead answer-block">Keres AI sells done-for-you growth services to local service businesses. Found builds and runs a business’s website, Google Business Profile, reviews and listings from $249 a month ($499 for law firms). Remi, its AI receptionist, answers every call in two rings, 24/7, and books the appointment. Theo, June and Sol handle reminders and estimate follow-up, past-customer reactivation, and outbound email.</p>
    <div class="hero-ctas"><a href="/quote" class="btn btn-primary">Get a quote</a></div>
  </header>

  <section class="page-section container">
    <div class="prose">
      <h2>What does Keres AI sell?</h2>
      <div class="compare-wrap">
        <table class="compare-table">
          <thead><tr><th>Worker</th><th>Job</th><th>Price</th></tr></thead>
          <tbody>
            <tr><td><a href="/services/found">Found</a></td><td>Website, Google Business Profile, reviews and listings</td><td>From $249/month ($499 for law firms)</td></tr>
            <tr><td><a href="/agents/inbound">Remi</a></td><td>AI receptionist: answers every call in two rings and books it</td><td>Quoted to call volume; included minutes, then per-minute; no per-call fees</td></tr>
            <tr><td><a href="/agents/follow-up">Theo</a></td><td>Confirmations, reminders and estimate follow-up</td><td>Quoted</td></tr>
            <tr><td><a href="/agents/reactivation">June</a></td><td>Brings past customers back and asks every customer for a review</td><td>Quoted</td></tr>
            <tr><td><a href="/agents/outbound">Sol</a></td><td>Outbound email with deliverability set up first</td><td>Quoted</td></tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>
      <p>Everything is month-to-month with no cancellation fee. See <a href="/pricing">pricing</a> for what changes a quote.</p>

      <h2>Who is Keres AI for?</h2>
      <p>Local businesses whose sales team is whoever picks up the phone: <a href="/industries/home-services">HVAC, plumbing, roofing and other home service contractors</a>, <a href="/industries/law-firms">law firms</a>, <a href="/industries/dental-med-spa">dental practices and med spas</a>, and <a href="/industries/real-estate">real estate agents and teams</a>, across the United States.</p>

      <h2>Why does it exist?</h2>
      <p>Keres AI estimates that service businesses miss 25–40% of inbound calls, and most callers who reach voicemail do not call back (<a href="/missed-call-statistics">how we got there</a>). The leads are there; the capacity to answer them often isn’t. Found makes sure the business is easy to find, and Remi makes sure the call that follows is answered and booked.</p>

      <h2>How does onboarding work?</h2>
      <p>A 20-minute call on how your calls and intake run today. We write the script, connect your number and your calendar or CRM, and you test it yourself before it answers a customer. Timing depends on your call flows and integrations, and we agree it on that first call.</p>

      <h2>What does Keres AI connect to?</h2>
      <p>Today: Google Calendar, HubSpot, ServiceTitan and Zapier. Rolling out: Jobber, Housecall Pro, Clio, Lawmatics, Follow Up Boss, Dentrix and Open Dental. See <a href="/integrations">integrations</a>.</p>

      <h2>What Keres AI does not do</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>It does not run Google Ads; it sets up and answers Local Services Ads.</li>
        <li>Remi never gives legal, medical or financial advice, and never clears a legal conflict itself.</li>
        <li>Keres AI is not SOC 2 or HIPAA certified and does not sign BAAs today (<a href="/trust">trust and security</a>).</li>
        <li>It never uses your data to train third-party AI models.</li>
        <li>Remi answers in English today.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Is Keres AI related to Keras, Kore.ai or keres.ai?</h2>
      <p>No. Keres AI (keresai.com) is not affiliated with keres.ai, the Keras deep-learning library or Kore.ai.</p>

      <h2>How do I contact Keres AI?</h2>
      <p>Email <a href={`mailto:${business.contactEmail}`}>{business.contactEmail}</a>, or <a href="/quote">get a quote</a> and book a 20-minute call.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <CtaBand heading="See what Keres can do for your business" sub="Book a 20-minute call and hear Remi answer and book a call live." />
</Layout>
